    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d39">

                <pb facs="0107" n="47" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg47"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mendonça to Mr. Gresham</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States of Brazil</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1895-03-16"><hi rendition="#italic">March 16,
                                1895</hi></date>. (Received March 18.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The minister of foreign relations of
                    Brazil, by cable of this date, directs me to communicate to your excellency that
                    the diplomatic relations <pb facs="0108" n="48" xml:id="pg48"/> between Brazil
                    and Portugal have been reestablished and assigns to me the agreeable duty of
                    offering to the President of the United States the sincerest thanks of the
                    Government of Brazil for the protection extended by the American minister at
                    Lisbon to the Brazilian citizens resident in Portugal and its possessions during
                    the suspension of the diplomatic relations between the two countries.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Salvador de
                    Mendonça</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
